WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:06.200
Your sister often warned me since we are of the royal family supported by the people we should.

00:06.280 --> 00:10.027
Strive to restore Xuan strive for the northern people.

00:11.080 --> 00:14.747
Body not among men but heart fiercer than men.

00:15.600 --> 00:21.560
When I recover the north she won't just be my empress but a hero of all Xuan.

00:30.280 --> 00:35.280
Brother-in-law I also wish to be like my sister to establish the heart of heaven and earth.

00:35.440 --> 00:39.320
To establish the destiny of the people for this chaotic age to open peace.

00:41.680 --> 00:46.520
Please grant this, brother-in-law good since that's the case.

00:47.080 --> 00:50.267
There's just one matter that only you can do.

00:55.480 --> 00:57.147
This is what Sheng'er wrote.

01:04.040 --> 01:09.920
Although there are still many areas needing improvement but I think you can help him perfect it.

01:10.640 --> 01:14.480
You're his uncle this matter I only trust you.

01:17.640 --> 01:23.320
I hope you'll go to Qingzhou to organize reforms change the original land tax system.

01:23.400 --> 01:28.520
From taxing by headcount to taxing by land in this way those with more land.

01:28.600 --> 01:33.600
Will pay more tax those with less land can pay less tax if successful.

01:33.960 --> 01:37.360
Then extend to the whole country qingzhou.

01:38.520 --> 01:41.040
That is lady Chen's hometown.

01:42.400 --> 01:43.440
What?

01:43.520 --> 01:48.067
Brother-in-law, don't worry this matter I will definitely do well.

01:49.800 --> 01:54.160
I said only talk about family matters drink.

01:57.400 --> 01:58.480
Come.

